# DeployerX

Mission: Forward-deployed AI for the rest of the world — decisioning + playbooks + locale packs to e/acc.

- Locale cascade: `_global` → L1 country → L2 → L3. Local wins. Deltas only at lower levels.
- Playbooks stay global under `playbooks/`. Never fork per district.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `schema/hierarchy.md` before structural changes.
- After locale/playbook/field-note edits: `python3 scripts/generate_site_data.py` then validate.
